## What we going to cover?

- Local Networking - Ethernet
- Routing
- Segmenting, Ports & Sessions
- Applications
- OSI 7-Layer Model

This is known as a Networking Stack or the software which does these functions. 

Items that include a networking stack: 

- Laptops
- Phones
- WiFi

7 Layers are split into 2 grouping:

Media Layers (Layers 1 - 3):

- Layer1 - Physical
- Layer2 - Data Link
- Layer3 - Network

Host Layers (Layers 4 - 7): 

- Layer4 - Transport
- Layer5 - Session
- Layer6 - Presentation
- Layer7 - Application
